                      "fill": "$text-2",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "The look the app follows. A radio-studio desk: the ON AIR sign says what is happening right now, the two decks show the mix, everything else stays dark and quiet.",
