                          "name": "Rationale",
                          "fill": "#ACA8B8",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": 780,
                          "content": "Broadcast signage for a dark room: the status reads like a lit sign from across the room. The decks are stacked as two lanes on one shared timeline, so you can see the songs overlap, the beats line up and the exact moment the bass swaps. Signal red means on air; lime is always deck A, violet is always deck B.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "Barlow",
                          "fontSize": 18,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
