                                  "fill": "$text-3",
                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "Deck colour follows the deck, never the role: A is lime even when it's the incoming song. Red means one thing only: on air. All text tokens pass AA on bg and surface (text-3 is 5.8:1 on bg, 5.4:1 on surface).",
