                                          "name": "Text",
                                          "fill": "$text-2",
                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "content": "dj_mcp._api() sends a header (e.g. X-Autodeck-Client: mcp + tool name + client name from the MCP session). The server logs those calls in a small ring buffer.",
