                                          "name": "Text",
                                          "fill": "$text-2",
                                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                          "width": "fill_container",
                                          "content": "Checked in the tool() wrapper: off refuses every tool; “only read” refuses tools with readOnlyHint false. The ToolError text says why, so the assistant can tell the user.",
