                          "content": "Same rule and limit as the planner (BEATMATCH_MAX_PCT, sent in /api/state). Compared with the analysed BPM of the song ON AIR; the incoming song once a mix hands over. Icon in the ready green right before the BPM, BPM tinted the same. Tooltip / aria-label: “Beat-matches what’s playing: blend, bass swap and filter sweep work”. Rows that don’t match show nothing extra. Shown in Up next, Library, Search and Suggestions; not on the playing song or in Played. Library and Search have no BPM column: the icon + BPM appear only on a match.",
